        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nzweso ja būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma niigwa ilaka itaale kūfuma ū mu hekalu līlībawīla a bamalaika abo mpungatī benabo gīkī, “Jagi mukashipumunhīle mu sī īsho shilīmo ū mu nzweso ja būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kwandya ūja ūūkashipumunhīla mu sī īsho shalī ū mu lweso lokwe; pye abo baalī na lūmeng'ho lwa shiinū na a babo bashilamyaga ī shiikolile shayo būgulumūkīlwa malonda mabi no, hama masaatu kīngī nasho! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kabīlī ūūkashipumunhīla mu nyanza īsho shalī ū mu lweso lokwe; a minzī gūgalūka gūbiza gītī mininga ga mfu! Pye ī shiseeng'wa shipanga ī sha mu nyanza shūshila kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kadatū ūūkashipumunhīla īsho shalī ū mu lweso lokwe mu myongo na mu nzwīlo ja minzī; gūbiza mininga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūng'wigwa ū malaika ū ntaale wa minzī wahaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika wa kane ūshipumunhīla ha līīmi īsho shalī ū mu lweso lokwe, linhwa būdūla bo kūbabbisha a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū būbbishiwa būsebu būtaale no, bandya kūlīdūkagūla ī lina lya ng'wa Mulungu ūyo akalagīla shibize ho ī sha kūluhya luhya shenīsho; na batagalūkile nūūlū hado, gīkī bandye kūng'winha ikūjo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa katanò ūshipumunhīla īsho shalī ū mu lweso lokwe h'isumbī lya būtemi lyayo ī shiinū; ū būtemi wa shiinū būbiza mu giiti; būyiluma ndīmi a banhū kūlwa makoye ayo gakabilongela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bandya kūndūkagūla ū Mulungu wa ng'wigūlū kūlwa nguno ya makoye gabo, nū būbi wa malonda gabo ayo gabakoyaga. Alīyo batagalūkile gīkī booye ī shītīle shabo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa katandatū ūshipumunhīla īsho shalī ū mu lweso lokwe mu līmongo ī litaale, ī Līfulati; gūkama a minzī gamò gīkī ībeejiwe nzīla ya batemi ba kūfuma kīya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nūbona myoyo idatū misoso ya kwikola gītī madanga; yūfuma ū mu nomo gwa Līshing'weng'we, nū mu nomo gwa shiinū, na mu nomo gwa ng'hangi nomolomo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū yoi īlī myoyo ya mashetani īyo īkabeejaga mihayo ya kūgekemaja; īkajaga hose hose ū kū batemi ba mu sī, īkūbalaalīkaga kūja kwilwisha būlūgū ū mu lūshikū lūtaale lo ng'wa Mulungu wa būdūla bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Managa gīkī, naliza gītī ng'wibi, alī na lubango ū wa kūsangwa alī miso ashilang'hanile ī shizwalo shakwe, atizūsangwa alī dūūhū manyegu, bakībona ī minala ya dūūhū yakwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī myoyo yenīyo īkababilingīla kwipandī īlo līkitanagwa ū mu lūlīmi lwa Shihebulania gīkī Alimagedoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika wa mpungatī ūshipumunhīla kū lūyaga īsho shalī ū mu lweso lwakwe; lyūfuma ilaka itaale ū mu hekalu līlīhaya gīkī, “Yashila!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna jūbiza ho ndabi na mihilimo na kūpalalūka, yūding'hima na nyahīnga nhaale, ītaalī kūbiza ho hangī nyahīnga nhaale gīko kūfuma aho banhū bandīja kwikala mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nzengo ū ntaale gūgabanīka mapandī adatū, ī mizengo ya mahanga nayo yūkenaagūka gete; ū Mulungu ūgwizūkwa kūgwinha shikombe sha mvinyo ya būpelanu bokwe ū nzengo ū ntaale ū gwa Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a majinga gūjimīīla, nī ngūlū jūūjimila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbula ya mawe yidīka kūfuma ng'wigūlū; gaalī mataale ga kūbiza na būdito bo kilo gītī makūmi atanò būlī lyene. Yūbatūla a banhū, nabo būyūndūkagūla ū Mulungu kūlwa nguno ya kūluhiwa nī mbula ya mawe yenīyo. Ī sha kūluhya luhya shenīsho shalī shabūbi no!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
